### Health stays public
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/health

### Protected without Bearer → 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/platform/config

### Register (public) → 2xx + accessToken
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1",
  "displayName": "JWT Gate"
}

### Login (public) → 2xx + accessToken
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

### Protected with Bearer → 2xx (paste accessToken from login)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/platform/config
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
